  "notes" : [
    {
      "note" : "# Coordinate Conversion\n\nThese Nodes Convert from 2d positions to 3d positions, and then to transforms we can use for instanced rendering\n\nLeaving a compose port empty makes it 0 :) ",
      "rect" : [
        [
          -286.36598114300614,
          -89.31414257341294
        ],
        [
          647.9103621983686,
          375.5111625015561
        ]
      ],
      "id" : "67DF8D2B-EEDF-4239-A5E1-760169A6A18F"
    },
    {
      "note" : "# Array Combine\n\nWe can combine all our data into a single array since we treat all points the same drawing wise!",
      "rect" : [
        [
          -847.3213067310598,
          419.33723590145564
        ],
        [
          392.44996362933944,
          1394.2910884990151
        ]
      ],
      "id" : "6511D8B9-D8E6-4094-ABED-B89D17DDC273"
    },
    {
      "note" : "We can also now re-title our Nodes to keep things organized!",
      "rect" : [
        [
          332.92449414929433,
          13.972236678329864
        ],
        [
          404.0834346460524,
